text en
APP.NAME Termplate setup wizard
HEADER.TITLE {@APP.NAME}
HEADER.STATE State:
SUMMARY.NAME Name:
SUMMARY.EMAIL Email:
SUMMARY.EDITION Edition:
SUMMARY.WORKERS Workers:
SUMMARY.VERBOSE Verbose:
SUMMARY.THEME Theme:
SUMMARY.TARGET Folder:
SUMMARY.PARTS Parts:
MAIN_MENU.TITLE Menu
MAIN_MENU.WIZARD Setup wizard…
MAIN_MENU.INSTALL Install again
MAIN_MENU.STOP Stop installing
MAIN_MENU.VIEW View settings
MAIN_MENU.SHELL Shell in the folder
MAIN_MENU.UNINSTALL Uninstall
MAIN_MENU.QUIT Quit
KEYBAR.TEXT {^open WELCOME} wizard · {^INSTALL} install · 1-8 workers · {^quit} quit
WELCOME.TITLE Welcome
WELCOME.TEXT This wizard collects a few settings in five steps and installs a demo into a folder of your choice. Enter goes on, Esc goes back a page.
WELCOME.NEXT Next
WELCOME.CANCEL Cancel
PROFILE.TITLE 1/5 Profile
PROFILE.NAME Name:
PROFILE.EMAIL Email:
PROFILE.PASSWORD Password:
PROFILE.EDITION Edition:
PROFILE.NAME_EMPTY Enter a name
PROFILE.EMAIL_BAD Like you@example.com
OPTIONS.TITLE 2/5 Options
OPTIONS.VERBOSE Verbose log: {VERBOSE}
OPTIONS.WORKERS Workers: {WORKERS}
OPTIONS.NEXT Next
OPTIONS.BACK Back
THEME_PICKER.TITLE 3/5 Theme
THEME_PICKER.HINT Arrows pick, {^confirm} chooses
TARGET_DIR.TITLE 4/5 Folder
TARGET_DIR.PROMPT Install into:
TARGET_DIR.INVALID Its parent folder does not exist
PART_LIST.TITLE 5/5 Parts (Insert marks)
PART_LIST.PART Part
PART_LIST.SIZE MB
CONFIRM.TITLE Ready
CONFIRM.TEXT Install {EDITION} ({THEME}) for {NAME}?
CONFIRM.INSTALL Install
CONFIRM.BACK Back
CONFIRM.CANCEL Cancel
INSTALL.CONFIRM Write files into the folder?
DONE.TITLE Installed
DONE.TEXT Installed into the folder.
DONE.VIEW View settings
DONE.SHELL Open a shell there
DONE.FINISH Finish
FAILED.TITLE Installation failed
FAILED.TEXT See the log, then try again or quit.
FAILED.RETRY Try again
FAILED.QUIT Quit
UNINSTALL.CONFIRM Remove the installed files?
